<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IntegratedCare - Agriculture & Ranching Solutions</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/styles.css">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background: #28a745;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .showcase {
            background: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .showcase h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
        .buttons {
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        .buttons a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            background: #28a745;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 0 1rem;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .buttons a:hover {
            background: #218838;
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        .feature {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 1rem;
            flex: 1;
            margin: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .feature h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem 0;
            background: #333;
            color: #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to IntegratedCare</h1>
        <p>Your one-stop platform for agriculture and ranching solutions</p>
    </header>

    <section class="showcase">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Efficiently Manage Crops, Ranches, and Diseases</h2>
            <p>Collaborate with experts, receive actionable solutions, and improve productivity.</p>
            <div class="buttons">
                <a href="/home/agriculture">For Crop Management</a>
                <a href="/home/ranchers">For Animal Management</a>
                <!-- <a href="/loginAuthority">Authority Login</a> -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container features">
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Comprehensive Crop Solutions</h3>
            <p>Submit crop issues and receive tailored advice from agrochemists and experts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Ranch Management</h3>
            <p>Manage your ranch efficiently with support from veterinary authorities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Real-Time Collaboration</h3>
            <p>Connect with agricultural and ranching experts for instant guidance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Secure & Reliable</h3>
            <p>Your data is protected and handled with the utmost security.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 IntegratedCare. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
